>> a := Akojọ ← Nkan ; Otitọ ; Irọ ; Buliani ; 1 ; Nọmba ; ['Str'] ; Ọrọ ; { ['Empty']. }.
Ijade kọ: (a iye-nọmba), ila-tuntun.
{ :i
	Ijade kọ: 
	['a '] + 
	((a ? i) oriṣi) +
	([' \‘this\’ '] this: (a ? i))  +
	[' is '] +
	(((a ? i) Ofo?) boya: [''] tabi: ['NOT']) + 
	[' Nil.'],
	ila-tuntun.
} × (a iye-nọmba).
Ijade kọ: ['but.. Nil is.. '] + ((Ofo Ofo?) boya: ['certainly NIL!'] tabi: ['not NIL??']), ila-tuntun.